{
  "an3.64:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.64 ",
  "an3.64:0.2": "7. Mahāvagga ",
  "an3.64:0.3": "Sarabhasutta ",
  "an3.64:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "an3.64:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā rājagahe viharati gijjhakūṭe pabbate. ",
  "an3.64:1.3": "Tena kho pana samayena sarabho nāma paribbājako acirapakkanto hoti imasmā dhammavinayā. ",
  "an3.64:1.4": "So rājagahe parisati evaṁ vācaṁ bhāsati: ",
  "an3.64:1.5": "“aññāto mayā samaṇānaṁ sakyaputtikānaṁ dhammo. ",
  "an3.64:1.6": "Aññāya ca panāhaṁ samaṇānaṁ sakyaputtikānaṁ dhammaṁ evāhaṁ tasmā dhammavinayā apakkanto”ti. ",
  "an3.64:1.7": "Atha kho sambahulā bhikkhū pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya rājagahaṁ piṇḍāya pavisiṁsu. ",
  "an3.64:1.8": "Assosuṁ kho te bhikkhū sarabhassa paribbājakassa rājagahe parisati evaṁ vācaṁ bhāsamānassa: ",
  "an3.64:1.9": "“aññāto mayā samaṇānaṁ sakyaputtikānaṁ dhammo. ",
  "an3.64:1.10": "Aññāya ca panāhaṁ samaṇānaṁ sakyaputtikānaṁ dhammaṁ evāhaṁ tasmā dhammavinayā apakkanto”ti. ",
  "an3.64:2.1": "Atha kho te bhikkhū rājagahe piṇḍāya caritvā pacchābhattaṁ piṇḍapātapaṭikkantā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu. Ekamantaṁ nisinnā kho te bhikkhū bhagavantaṁ etadavocuṁ: ",
  "an3.64:2.2": "“sarabho nāma, bhante, paribbājako acirapakkanto imasmā dhammavinayā. ",
  "an3.64:2.3": "So rājagahe 